{
  "name": "Viralyn — Onboard Client (Form)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Viralyn — Nouvel Onboarding Client",
        "formDescription": "Renseigner l'URL du site web du client. L'agent Claude analysera le site et créera automatiquement le profil client + catalogue produits dans Airtable.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "URL du site web",
              "fieldType": "text",
              "requiredField": true,
              "placeholder": "https://example.com"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Nom du client (optionnel)",
              "fieldType": "text",
              "requiredField": false,
              "placeholder": "Ex: Le Resto Genève"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "respondWithData": true
        }
      },
      "id": "form-trigger",
      "name": "Formulaire Onboarding",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [240, 400],
      "webhookId": "onboard-form"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://localhost:3000/agent/onboard",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"url\": {{ JSON.stringify($json[\"URL du site web\"]) }},\n  \"name\": {{ JSON.stringify($json[\"Nom du client (optionnel)\"] || \"\") }}\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "http-call-agent",
      "name": "Call Onboard Agent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [520, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "check-success",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.success }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true" }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "if-success",
      "name": "Agent Success?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [780, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "r1",
              "name": "message",
              "value": "=✅ Client onboardé avec succès !\n\nClient : {{ $json.customer.Customer_Name }} ({{ $json.customer.Customer_ID }})\nSecteur : {{ $json.customer.Customer_Market }}\nProduits extraits : {{ $json.productsCount }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-success-msg",
      "name": "Format Success",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1040, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "r2",
              "name": "message",
              "value": "=❌ Erreur lors de l'onboarding.\n\nDétails : {{ $json.error || $json.details || 'Erreur inconnue' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-error-msg",
      "name": "Format Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1040, 500]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "note-form",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [160, 160],
      "parameters_extra": {
        "content": "## Viralyn — Onboard Client (Form)\n\n**Point d'entrée** : Formulaire n8n (URL + Nom optionnel)\n\n**Flow :**\n1. Formulaire → collecte URL + nom\n2. HTTP Request → POST /agent/onboard (Express)\n3. L'agent Express utilise Claude (web_search) pour :\n   - Analyser le site web\n   - Extraire profil client + catalogue produits\n   - Valider les données\n   - Notifier Slack\n   - Envoyer au webhook onboard-client (CRUD Airtable)\n4. Affiche le résultat (succès / erreur)\n\n**Important :** Ce workflow utilise l'agent Express déployé.\nL'agent appelle ensuite le workflow `Onboard Client` (webhook)\npour la création des records Airtable."
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Formulaire Onboarding": {
      "main": [
        [
          { "node": "Call Onboard Agent", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Call Onboard Agent": {
      "main": [
        [
          { "node": "Agent Success?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Agent Success?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Format Success", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Format Error", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "tags": [
    { "name": "viralyn" },
    { "name": "onboarding" }
  ]
}
